---
source: crates/mori-checker/src/tests.rs
description: "Code:\n\nprofile \"moriarty-beta/1\";\nagreement Operations {\n  domain Preview = { id: \"preview\", chain: \"midnight\", network: \"preview\" };\n  intent none = { nonce: \"n\" };\n  intent text = { operation: \"transfer\" };\n  intent window = { operation: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 1) };\n}\n"
---
mori::check::intent_without_operation

  × This intent has no `operation`.
   ╭─[test.mori:4:17]
 3 │   domain Preview = { id: "preview", chain: "midnight", network: "preview" };
 4 │   intent none = { nonce: "n" };
   ·                 ───────┬──────
   ·                        ╰── needs an `operation`
 5 │   intent text = { operation: "transfer" };
   ╰────
  help: An intent authorizes one operation, written as a call:

            operation: transfer(
              from: alice, to: bob, fee_to: carol,
              value: 10 USD, fee: 0 USD,
            ),

mori::check::operation_not_a_call

  × An intent's `operation` must be a call, but this is a string.
   ╭─[test.mori:5:30]
 4 │   intent none = { nonce: "n" };
 5 │   intent text = { operation: "transfer" };
   ·                              ─────┬────
   ·                                   ╰── this is a string
 6 │   intent window = { operation: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 1) };
   ╰────
  help: Write the operation as a call, like `transfer(...)` or `repay(...)`.

mori::check::unsupported_operation

  × `rounds` cannot be an intent's operation.
   ╭─[test.mori:6:32]
 5 │   intent text = { operation: "transfer" };
 6 │   intent window = { operation: rounds(domain: Preview, from: 0, to: 1) };
   ·                                ───────────────────┬───────────────────
   ·                                                   ╰── not an operation
 7 │ }
   ╰────
  help: An intent runs `transfer` or `repay`, or a family call such as
        `amm.swap_exact_input`.
